# 统一换行符：入库与检出都用 LF，避免在 Windows 上反复出现
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告，也避免同一文件在不同机器上产生无意义 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件明确排除，不参与换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 文本类明确标注
*.md text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.html text
*.css text
*.js text
*.json text
*.svg text
*.py text
*.sh text
